window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>For two former childhood friends, a blustery winter storm stirs some frosty—and scorching—memories in a delightfully sexy short story by #1 <i>New York Times</i> bestselling author Ali Hazelwood.</p> <p>All newly minted pediatrician Jamie Malek wants is to borrow a roasting pan for Christmas dinner. Unfortunately, that requires her to interact with Marc—her best friend’s troublemaking brother, who’s now a tech billionaire. He’s the one who got away. She’s the one who broke his heart. Outside, a howling blizzard. Inside, a crackling fire. Suddenly, being snowbound with the man she never expected to see again might not be such a bad way to spend a winter’s night.</p> <p><i>Ali Hazelwood’s</i> Cruel Winter with You<i> is part of </i>Under the Mistletoe<i>, a collection of sexy December romances to warm the cold winter nights. They can be read or listened to in one swoony sitting.</i></p>"; 
